 seaux dans les zones de passage, mauvaises postures de travail, casserole oubli\u00e9e sur le feu, risques d\u2019incendie ou encore risques de chute li\u00e9s aux sols glissants.", "short_description": "Plongez-vous au c\u0153ur d\u2019un laboratoire de boulangerie o\u00f9 la vigilance est de mise \u00e0 chaque \u00e9tape du travail. Apprenez \u00e0 rep\u00e9rer et pr\u00e9venir les dangers du quotidien : couteaux laiss\u00e9s sur le plan de travail, seaux dans les zones de passage, mauvaises postures de travail, casserole oubli\u00e9e sur le feu, risques d\u2019incendie ou encore risques de chute li\u00e9s aux sols glissants."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "carre.png", "id": "26062120623488465", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821719_26062120643488463_1080510041386831045_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-oyqOaypPIQ7kNvwF7FN7U&_nc_oc=AdrHUotR0PbcbTwpF3fBE6RhPtH4wS8oX-uQhIi4sF5_kYO2Z0AMynisB5Ue6zQJvBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHeb-HmUwHfTlph52SDGcuM5q6jCGq15b5qz_QJukbEAQ&oe=6A70A0AC"}, {"file_name": "Paysage.png", "id": "1965893907383434", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1965893910716767_7946093978384960192_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=khcBZ2WAY2kQ7kNvwFiThbB&_nc_oc=Adqx7v9D8A9byGr-N6K4vunGDUQNSsL87HCsHDHd2RXtveeZ9p1Gc-hPxd0-9K40yog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHMBr98ZtXynMmsBCiyL-CJomL9gvanCnYWrKKNDTSbBw&oe=6A70743B"}, {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "1862865251048291", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1862865254381624_1627436020223417036_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m7hBFLByHsUQ7kNvwEfIFcS&_nc_oc=AdoGITQJPOx0aqPeFc4U8jTpLTS7u_WlUWyfnL7UDEE4sUSXeAPebdqS3K0lzJdoR1w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oc